{"t":"Newhaven","s":"newhaven-17a12","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Map_newhaven_4cc7a7.jpg","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Newhaven</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Map newhaven\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"243\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Map_newhaven_4cc7a7.jpg\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Corrupted%20Mines\">Corrupted Mines</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Muglex%20Clan%20Camp\">Muglex Clan Camp</a></li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/newhaven-legion-helmet-quest\">Newhaven Legion Helmet Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/newhaven-quest\">Newhaven Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">15.12.c7d92c<br/>October 21, 2025<br/>Newhaven Update</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Newhaven</b> was first mentioned on October 8, 2025 as the new beginner's island. It was implemented in Update 15.12.c7d92c.\n</p><p>Newhaven is a peaceful coastal settlement located just east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Bounac\">Bounac</a>. It serves as the first home for new adventurers entering the world of Tibia. Here, players meet a handful of helpful residents: a trader who buys local loot and sells hunting supplies such as potions and ammunition, a banker, quest givers and a spell trainer who offers a few basic spells for each vocation.\n</p><p>The village has two exits: \n</p>\n<ul><li>to the north lies the hunting ground, where adventurers can face various monsters to gain experience and prepare for the challenges ahead</li>\n<li>to the west, the exist remains sealed by a special level door, only opening for those who have reached level eight. Behind it waits a boat that sails most <a href=\"#/wiki/Vocation\">vocations</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> peninsula, a one-way journey into the true dangers of the mainland. Only <a href=\"#/wiki/Monk\">Monks</a> are taken to <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Valley\">Blue Valley</a> instead.</li></ul>\n<p>Once adventurers leave <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Newhaven</strong>, they can never return. The island is a safe haven of learning, guidance and preparation for a new generation of Tibian heroes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span id=\"w-Newhaven_NPCs_.287_NPCs.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Newhaven_NPCs_(7_NPCs)\">Newhaven NPCs (7 NPCs)</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>Job\n</th>\n<th>Buy/Sell\n</th>\n<th>Location\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Seagull\">A Seagull</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Seagull\"><img alt=\"A Seagull\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/A_Seagull_eeeefd.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Clairvoyant\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Southwest of <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Newhaven</strong>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Anna\">Anna</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Anna\"><img alt=\"Anna\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Anna_3c44b0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Ship Captain\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td